  "description": "It doesn’t matter when you launch your attack. On a brutal climb, amidst the chaos of a breakaway, or carving through tight corners on a blistering descent, the UCI-approved ULTRA-RACE is built to deliver in every race situation. The featherlight 775g frame is constructed from next-generation MT65 carbon with zonal deployment for maximised stiffness and power transfer where it counts. SRAM’s fully wireless Force AXS E1 groupset delivers crisp, effortless shifts, while Vision SC45 carbon wheels, Pirelli P Zero Race tyres, and a race-tuned Selle Italia SLR saddle keep you fast, confident, and in control. Topped off with a one-piece aero cockpit, the ULTRA-RACE isn’t just built to compete—it’s built to win.",
